- Add time pressure (input timer).
- Add multi-grid modes (4x4, 5x5).
- Add life system (e.g., 3 mistakes allowed).

============================================================
📝 BLOCK 10 — HUMAN NOTES
------------------------------------------------------------
Pedagogical:
